# Slice 282 probe: `@: place value` with an indexed place: an element of an Array of references.  Entry 7.
Inner:
    int: q 2
end: Inner
Other:
    int: q 3
end: Other
[]: @(Inner) list 2
int: code 7
@: list[0] Inner
@: list[1] Other
if: list[0]\q != 2
    code: 11
---
if: code = 7 && list[1]\q != 3
    code: 12
---
sendMessage: exit(exit_code: code; stdout: ""; stderr: "")
return
